        mountCategory = "Vendor",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A short introduction and reputation grind; repeatable Onyx Eggs can replace waiting for daily resets.\n\n1. Start Wild Things with Elder Anli at the Arboretum in the Jade Forest (57.7,45.0). Fly northeast to Instructor Tong on Windward Isle (65.3,31.6).\n\n2. Complete Beating the Odds, Empty Nests and Egg Collection together: kill the attacking saurok, rescue hatchlings and collect eggs around Windward Isle. Return all three to Tong.\n\n3. Accept Choosing the One and select the green egg. Take The Rider's Journey back to Instructor Skythorn at the Arboretum and finish It's A... to hatch your serpent.\n\n4. Earn reputation from the offered Arboretum/hatchling dailies, or search Windward Isle's rock pillars and ledges for Onyx Eggs. Deliver eggs to Elder Anli through repeatable Onyx To Goodness. Eggs are small, dark objects; a marked search area does not guarantee a spawn.\n\n5. At Revered buy and use Grand Commendation of the Order of the Cloud Serpent from San Redscale (56.6,44.4). Complete They Grow Like Weeds and Windblade's three Flight Training quests; use the vehicle controls and pass the marked rings/checkpoints.\n\n6. At Exalted return to Elder Anli for Riding the Skies and learn your chosen colour. If a different colour was raised, buy Jade Cloud Serpent from San Redscale instead. Check bags and the Mount Journal after the reward.",
    },
