        mountCategory = "Vendor",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Several daily resets or enough Timewalking reputation tokens are required.\n\n1. Travel to Anglers Wharf on the south coast of Krasarang Wilds. Train Fishing if needed and ask the fishermen around 70.8,40.1 for their offered blue daily quests.\n\n2. Finish that day's three Anglers assignments using each supplied bait, fishing spot or quest item, then turn them in. Ordinary fishing by itself does not raise The Anglers reputation.\n\n3. At Revered buy and use Grand Commendation of the Anglers from Nat Pagle (68.4,43.4) before earning the remaining reputation.\n\n4. Alternatively, during Pandaria Timewalking buy Commendation of the Anglers from Mistweaver Xia on the Timeless Isle for Timewarped Badges. Use tokens on the purchasing character, pause at Revered for the Grand Commendation, then continue to Exalted.\n\n5. At Exalted buy Reins of the Azure Water Strider from Nat Pagle and use the reins. His personal friendship bar does not need to be Best Friend.",
