        tips = "",
        mountCategory = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Nine reputation requirements, with repeatable/token shortcuts for several of them.\n\n1. Track Pandaren Ambassador (achievement 6827). Reach Exalted with The Anglers, The August Celestials, Golden Lotus, The Klaxxi, The Lorewalkers, Order of the Cloud Serpent, Shado-Pan, The Tillers and Huojin Pandaren. Later factions such as Emperor Shaohao and the Isle of Thunder factions are not part of this original nine-faction requirement.\n\n2. Combine each faction grind with its mounts: Anglers Wharf fishing dailies, rotating Celestial temples, the Golden Lotus hub, the Klaxxi story/dailies, Arboretum training and eggs, Shado-Pan Garrison, and Yoon's farm/Tillers dailies. The map choices mark the actual hubs.\n\n3. For Lorewalkers, follow the Red Flying Cloud lore-object route and deliver the mailed story scrolls to Cho. For Huojin Pandaren, use its capital tabard in compatible legacy dungeons or a Pandaren's racial reputation route.\n\n4. Use Grand Commendations at Revered where offered. Zandalari stolen insignias and Pandaria Timewalking commendations can replace much of the daily waiting; use the correct faction's token and watch the achievement criteria update.\n\n5. When all nine criteria are credited, check the Mount Journal for Pandaren Kite and your mailbox/bags for Pandaren Kite String. Some current rewards are added automatically; repeatedly checking mail is unnecessary if the journal already shows it learned.",
    },
