        mountCategory = "Other",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A direct Auction House purchase or a costly four-mount craft and Exalted recipe.\n\n1. Compare the Auction House price of a finished Jeweled Onyx Panther with the combined price of its four coloured components. Buying the finished item requires no profession or reputation.\n\n2. To make your own, train Pandaria Jewelcrafting to 75 and earn Exalted with the Order of the Cloud Serpent. Buy Design: Jeweled Onyx Panther (83877) from San Redscale at the Arboretum.\n\n3. Craft or buy one EACH of Sapphire Panther, Jade Panther, Ruby Panther and Sunstone Panther. Leave all four as unused items in your bags; learned mounts cannot be used as reagents.\n\n4. Combine those four items using the Jeweled Onyx Panther recipe, then use the finished mount. To collect all five appearances you need a second set of coloured panthers to learn separately.",
