        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Unlock the Klaxxi and earn Exalted through story quests, dailies or reputation tokens.\n\n1. Enter the Dread Wastes from the Serpent's Spine. Start Dread Space / the Bowmistress Li introduction on the wall and follow the Terrace of Gurthan rescue through Preserved in Amber to awaken Kil'ruk.\n\n2. Follow Kil'ruk back to Klaxxi'vess and finish The Klaxxi Council. Continue the zone's paragon-rescue story and the unlocked Klaxxi daily hubs; the next-quest display follows your unfinished introduction.\n\n3. For repeatable reputation, hand Dread Amber Shards to Ambersmith Zikk or use Stolen Klaxxi Insignias from Zandalari rares. Pandaria Timewalking commendations are another option while that event is active.\n\n4. At Revered buy and use Grand Commendation of the Klaxxi from Zikk before further reputation gains.\n\n5. At Exalted return to Ambersmith Zikk at Klaxxi'vess (55.0,35.5), buy Reins of the Amber Scorpion and use the reins.",
