        mountCategory = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Join a guild with the unlock, earn Exalted guild reputation, then buy the mount.\n\n1. Inspect the guild's achievements for Guild Glory of the Pandaria Raider (6682). Joining a guild that already has it is the shortest route; personal Glory of the Pandaria Raider does not replace the guild unlock.\n\n2. If the guild still needs the unlock, complete the required Heroic final-boss guild runs with the required number of eligible guild members: Will of the Emperor, Grand Empress Shek'zeer and Sha of Fear. Check the guild criterion rather than assuming a solo personal kill counts as a guild run.\n\n3. Earn Exalted reputation with that guild through eligible quests and guild activities. Use a guild reputation tabard when available; the old guild-level system and Bartering perk no longer apply.\n\n4. Visit Shay Pressler in Stormwind (64.0,77.4) or Goram in Orgrimmar (48.4,75.8), buy Reins of the Thundering Jade Cloud Serpent and use them. The old separate Cloud Serpent Riding requirement is gone.",
