        mountCategory = "Other",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A costly direct purchase, or a maximum-skill profession craft with a specialization requirement.\n\n1. Search the Auction House for the exact finished mount, Depleted-Kyparium Rocket. Buying it avoids the profession, specialization and reagent work.\n\n2. For self-crafting, learn Goblin Engineering through its current specialization trainer route, then train Pandaria Engineering with Sally Fizzlefury at Nesingwary's Safari in the Valley of the Four Winds (16.0,83.0). Raise the Pandaria skill to 75.\n\n3. Learn the Depleted-Kyparium Rocket recipe (spell 127138). Gather twelve Living Steel, two hundred Kyparite, twelve High-Explosive Gunpowder, twelve Spirit of Harmony, twenty Ghost Iron Bolts and three Orbs of Mystery. Big Keech sells the orbs in the earlier Vale; they normally cost 20,000 gold each.\n\n4. If Big Keech is missing in the assault phase, talk to Zidormi near the Seat of Knowledge and choose the earlier Vale. Buy only the quantity shown by this rocket's recipe; the two rockets have different component lists.\n\n5. Craft the mount, then use the finished item from your bags. A crafter can also sell or trade it to a character without Engineering.",
    },
