        mountCategory = "Quest Rewards",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Reach Exalted, then complete two straightforward finale quests.\n\n1. Earn Exalted with the Shado-Pan using the garrison dailies, stolen insignias or Pandaria Timewalking commendations. At Revered buy the Grand Commendation from Rushi the Fox before finishing the grind.\n\n2. At Shado-Pan Garrison, accept Mogu Incursions (31266) from the Shado-Pan quest giver near 49.5,70.5. Locate and kill the Shan'ze Spymaster indicated by the quest, then return.\n\n3. Accept Surprise Attack! (31277). Meet Ban Bearheart outside Niuzao Temple and join his battle against the mogu invasion. Stay for the event's completion credit rather than killing a few invaders and leaving.\n\n4. Return to the quest's indicated hand-in and collect Reins of the Onyx Cloud Serpent. Use them from your bags; a completed 31277 on this character should not send you back to the first quest.",
