        reviewedAt = "2026-11-13",
        itemId = 87769,
        name = "Crimson Cloud Serpent",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=87769",
        mountCategory = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 17,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Multiple setup mechanics, a six-dungeon potion route and some easier-to-coordinate group interactions.\n\n1. Set dungeon difficulty to Heroic. Start in current Scholomance in Western Plaguelands, not the restored original Scholomance. Kill Professor Slate, take an Empty Polyformic Acid Vial, click the potion on his table and store a dose; refresh the table's disguise before leaving. The spare vial preserves additional uses for Polyformic Acid Science.\n\n2. In Scholomance, kill only the real Jandice Barov image for Attention to Detail; look for the image whose appearance differs and avoid AoE. Kill Rattlegore before more than five Rusting stacks. Keep a Krastinovian Carver alive until 99 Boiling Bloodthirst stacks for Sanguinarian, then kill it.\n\n3. For School's Out Forever, gather fifty Expired Test Subjects around Gandling's classrooms before killing them together within twenty seconds. Do not clear each small pack separately. Finish the Heroic dungeon if its clear criterion is missing.\n\n4. In Scarlet Halls, kill Houndmaster Braun without killing hounds for Humane Society. For Mosh Pit, preserve enough Scarlet Defenders for eight combined players/defenders to be caught in one Blades of Light; do not kill Harlan until the spin has collected them. A group makes the count easier.\n\n5. In Scarlet Monastery, keep Brother Korloff alive and position his fire attacks over all six nearby training dummies for Burning Man. At Whitemane, allow Mass Resurrection, kill the thirteen revived Scarlet Judicators and then finish her for And Stay Dead!.\n\n6. At Temple of the Jade Serpent, avoid Mari's water, Hydrolance and Wash Away for Hydrophobia. For Cleaning Up, clear the Lorewalker encounter first, kill Mari while staying close enough to receive Purified Water, then finish Liu and Sha of Doubt within that buff's five minutes.\n\n7. Before killing the Sha of Doubt, activate the four Seeds of Doubt in the final room and confirm all four stacks for Seeds of Doubt. Kill Liu Flameheart under the Polyformic Acid disguise for the potion checklist; refresh a stored dose before that kill if needed.\n\n8. At Stormstout Brewery, ride and steer twenty Rolling Brew Barrels into Ook-Ook before killing him. In Hoptallus' area, gather one hundred virmen and use ONE dropped hammer smash to hit them together. Keep a hammer for the Hozen Clinger and use its smash beneath the hanging hozen for How Did He Get Up There?.\n\n9. Buy Ling-Ting's tea from Auntie Stormstout at the entrance, use it to see the hidden Golden Hoplings and collect all thirty across the cleared brewery; renew the tea when it expires. Kill Yan-Zhu while disguised for Polyformic Acid Science.\n\n10. At Mogu'shan Palace, collect the five Jade Quilen around the dungeon. Once the Glintrok Scout spots the group, reach and defeat Gekkan and his entourage within five minutes. Kill Trial of the King while the potion disguise is active.\n\n11. For Xin's What Does This Button Do?, lower him carefully through 66% and 33%. Leave the first red gem alone until the second appears in the opposite lion mouth; coordinate the northwest and southeast clicks. When their beams activate the third lion-mouth defense, click its newly available gem and move Xin into the resulting beam. Merely activating the first two beams is insufficient. Two clickers are the straightforward route.\n\n12. At Shado-Pan Monastery, kill Gu Cloudstrike while disguised. During Snowdrift's novice event, target each defeated bowing initiate and /bow back before continuing until twenty are credited. Do not rush past the defeated novices.\n\n13. Open the Sealed Chambers and kill all remaining imprisoned sha before the Sha of Violence for The Obvious Solution. At Taran Zhu, let every party member reach maximum hatred and avoid using Meditation until the boss dies for Hate Leads to Suffering.\n\n14. At Gate of the Setting Sun, let Kip'tilak place enough explosives, then trigger fifteen detonations within fifteen seconds for Bomberman. Kill Mantid Conscripts while their Resin Residue can build to three stacks for Conscriptinator. Kill Commander Ri'mok under the potion disguise.\n\n15. At Siege of Niuzao Temple, kill Vizier Jin'bak while disguised. In Vo'jak's defense event, kill the flying Sik'thik Amberwing before finishing the commander for Where's My Air Support?.\n\n16. At General Pa'valak, stop damage at the shield phase, collect and throw the siege explosives back at him until he has twenty Detonate stacks, then kill him. At Ner'onok, during the FIRST Gusting Winds take a running jump to Tenwu's side platform, speak to Tenwu and use his return teleport. Kill Ner'onok while the two-minute Tenwu's Resolve buff remains.\n\n17. Check Polyformic Acid Science for all six disguised Heroic kills: Ri'mok, Liu Flameheart, Gu Cloudstrike, Trial of the King, Jin'bak and Yan-Zhu. Reacquire the potion if any were missed. Confirm all nine Heroic clears and every remaining 6927 criterion, then check the journal/mail for the Crimson Cloud Serpent.",
    },
