        mountCategory = "Vendor",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Build Exalted reputation through rotating temple dailies or commendations.\n\n1. Meet Sage Whiteheart at the Alliance shrine (84.6,63.6) or Sage Lotusbloom at the Horde shrine (62.8,23.4) in the earlier Vale. Ask which Celestial temple needs help today.\n\n2. Visit the assigned temple and finish that hub's offered dailies: Temple of the Jade Serpent, Red Crane, White Tiger or Niuzao. The active hub rotates; do not wait at the wrong temple for missing quests.\n\n3. At Revered buy and use Grand Commendation of the August Celestials. Stolen Celestial Insignias from Zandalari rares and Pandaria Timewalking commendations can supply additional reputation.\n\n4. Once Exalted, return to your faction's sage, buy Reins of the Thundering August Cloud Serpent and learn them. Order of the Cloud Serpent Exalted and the old special riding skill are not required.",
    },
