        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - The farm introduction and daily reputation work precede the purchase.\n\n1. Go to Halfhill in the Valley of the Four Winds and meet Farmer Yoon at Sunsong Ranch (52.0,48.0). Start A Helping Hand and follow the Learn and Grow lessons through Halfhill Market.\n\n2. Use the taught farm actions: till soil, plant the requested seed, water parched crops, spray infested crops and clear weeds or vermin. Harvest mature crops after the daily reset and complete the offered Tillers blue quests around Halfhill.\n\n3. Raise The Tillers faction to Exalted. Gifts for Gina, Jogu and the other farmers mainly advance their personal friendship; do not mistake Best Friend with one farmer for Exalted with The Tillers.\n\n4. At Revered buy and use Grand Commendation of the Tillers from Gina Mudclaw. Pandaria Timewalking Tillers commendations can supplement or replace the daily reputation grind.\n\n5. At Exalted buy Brown Riding Goat from Gina Mudclaw at Halfhill Market (53.2,51.6), then use its reins. The three goat colours are separate purchases.",
