        difficultyReason = "The legacy fight is easy, but random loot and weekly character eligibility can require repeated resets.",
        commentIds = { 5471655, 1825238, 5548123, 1803430, 3161590 },
        tips = "A repeated kill after this week's normal loot does not create another normal mount roll. Bonus rolls use the boss-specific currency. The old Cloud Serpent Riding unlock is unnecessary.",
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 376, x = 0.708, y = 0.635, step = 1, label = "Galleon - outdoor boss spawn area" },
            { mapID = 554, x = 0.428, y = 0.556, step = 2, label = "Mistweaver Ai - bonus-roll currency exchanges" },
        },
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-13",
        itemId = 89783,
        name = "Son of Galleon",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=89783",
        mountCategory = "Rare Drops",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The legacy fight is easy, but random loot and weekly character eligibility can require repeated resets.\n\n1. Travel to Valley of the Four Winds and wait at Galleon's marked spawn area. Check that you are in the same War Mode/phase as anyone sharing the spawn.\n\n2. Before pulling, check whether this character has already looted Galleon this week. For an additional eligible roll, bring a Elder Charm of Good Fortune. Elder Charms can be bought from Mistweaver Ai on the Timeless Isle; Mogu Runes come from Mistweaver Ai's exchange for Timeless Coins.\n\n3. When the boss is attackable, land a damaging hit while it is alive. Let other waiting players tag it; merely standing nearby or arriving after the kill is not a dependable loot claim.\n\n4. Kill Galleon, check the personal-loot result and use the bonus-roll prompt if you brought the correct token. This outdoor boss can award its mount on a bonus roll; this rule does not apply to instanced raid mounts.\n\n5. If Son of Galleon is awarded, use its mount item. Otherwise return after the weekly reset or use a different eligible character. Waiting for a respawn on the same already-looted character does not refresh the normal weekly chance.",
    },
