        reviewedAt = "2026-11-13",
        itemId = 90655,
        name = "Thundering Ruby Cloud Serpent",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=90655",
        tips = "",
        mountCategory = "Rare Drops",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A direct Auction House purchase, or a lengthy shard farm followed by a guaranteed crystal reward.\n\n1. Check the Auction House for Reins of the Thundering Ruby Cloud Serpent. You can buy and learn this mount directly without August Celestials reputation or Cloud Serpent Riding.\n\n2. To farm it yourself, collect ten Skyshards from eligible Vale of Eternal Blossoms creatures/Guo-Lai treasures and combine them into one Sky Crystal. Consolidate your shards on the character that will use the crystal.\n\n3. If you cannot find Alani in the assault phase, speak to Zidormi near the Seat of Knowledge (81.2,29.6) and choose the earlier Vale. Search Alani's aerial circuit through the central and western Vale; the map pins are search areas, not fixed spawn guarantees.\n\n4. Find Alani, land somewhere within range and use your Sky Crystal on her. Check your bags immediately for the reins; current rewards can be delivered directly when the crystal is consumed. If she remains in combat, finish the encounter and check the loot.\n\n5. Learn or trade the reins. Only one mount is produced per crystal; do not follow old comments promising every party member a mount.",
    },
}

